{
  "_comment": [
    "The reader table: every private key under data/tls, who reads it, and how.",
    "One source for three checks: the mint (src/backend/tls_ca_custody_test.go), the installer's --verify-custody (scripts/install.py) and the compose shape test (tests/test_tls_key_custody.py).",
    "Paths are relative to data/tls. A key not listed here is a custody violation.",
    "how: owner = the reader runs as CORRELIX_UID. group = the reader runs as another uid, or as root without CAP_DAC_OVERRIDE, and holds CORRELIX_GID through group_add. root = the reader is root with Docker's default capabilities, which read a 0600 file of any owner. staged = root copies the key at start into a location owned by the reader. dormant = minted for a later epic, no container mounts it.",
    "effective is what was verified on the pinned image on 2026-11-09, in compose.tls.yml. Nothing here depends on CORRELIX_UID being 1000."
  ],
  "dirs": {
    ".": "0700",
    "services": "0700",
    "admin": "0700",
    "nginx": "0750",
    "victoria": "0700"
  },
  "keys": [
    {"path": "api.key", "mode": "0600", "how": "owner", "readers": ["api"], "effective": "CORRELIX_UID, cap_drop ALL"},
    {"path": "admin/admin.key", "mode": "0600", "how": "owner", "readers": ["opensearch-security-init"], "effective": "CORRELIX_UID:1000"},
    {"path": "nginx/nginx.key", "mode": "0640", "how": "group", "readers": ["nginx"], "effective": "101:101, cap_drop ALL"},
    {"path": "victoria/victoria.key", "mode": "0600", "how": "root", "readers": ["victoria"], "effective": "0:0, default caps"},
    {"path": "services/api/api.key", "mode": "0600", "how": "owner", "readers": ["api"], "effective": "CORRELIX_UID, cap_drop ALL"},
    {"path": "services/cadvisor/cadvisor.key", "mode": "0600", "how": "dormant", "readers": [], "effective": "not mounted"},
    {"path": "services/clickhouse/clickhouse.key", "mode": "0600", "how": "staged", "readers": ["clickhouse"], "effective": "0:0 wrapper stages for uid 101"},
    {"path": "services/cloud-ingest/cloud-ingest.key", "mode": "0640", "how": "group", "readers": ["cloud-ingest"], "effective": "1000:1000 (poller)"},
    {"path": "services/correlation/correlation.key", "mode": "0640", "how": "group", "readers": ["correlation"], "effective": "10001:10001, cap_drop ALL"},
